# Release bundle: GENERATED by scripts/release (New-ReleaseBundle.ps1 / new-release-bundle.sh)
# from a commit, inside the air-gapped environment. Never committed; the archive and its
# release-manifest.json are the record. See docs/release-bundle.md.
/release/
